{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907910/extras/31ba0abd2d434e6e7620da8ecd0cb8d3.poster.avif?t=1772550075\" width=1080 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907910/extras/31ba0abd2d434e6e7620da8ecd0cb8d3.webm?t=1772550075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Cutout Village</strong> is a cozy, city-builder and crafting game with an atmospheric narrative about village abandonment. Whether you play in story mode or sandbox, you will have options to customize your medieval-inspired village using building and decoration sheets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2702\ufe0f<strong>\u00a0Cutting, folding and gluing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mechanics are simple and unique: cut, fold and glue the sheets you collect to unlock new levels with services, and increase population capacity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This will remind you of old hobbies such as paper crafts, and cutout books that became extremely popular in the 1960s. <br>Each level will require some tasks that need to be managed with the calm that comes with village life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907910/extras/3234d421fb5dd74ebd0df0198e0bdeee.avif?t=1772550075\" width=1080 height=512 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf43 The atmospheric narrative we have all dreamed of</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who hasn't dreamed of bringing back to life a village with friends? In Cutout Village, you will join our main characters through a single-player story that begins with inheriting an old family house in a village where they used to spend their childhood, but is now abandoned.<br>Experience a narrative revealed through the characters and the city\u2019s needs, while enjoying a small and relaxing indie game inspired by watercolors and crafting books.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907910/extras/5a8229bead72575bd12ae2dd8af39e73.avif?t=1772550075\" width=1080 height=310 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc1d Key features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 cutout buildings and street furniture.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-mode with an immersive narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandbox to design and expand your village without limits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse fruit trees to collect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique and relaxing mechanic perfect for chilling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907910/extras/1fa247e9ba1685e4c6ebc7de5d7c30ad.avif?t=1772550075\" width=1080 height=360 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3907910?t=1772550075","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907910/6782496f08f5e355494971d995e6332ecf431caf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772550075","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907910/e4f58cbb493eadc54a2ecb610f16bfcb763f02f0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772550075","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907910/e4f58cbb493eadc54a2ecb610f16bfcb763f02f0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772550075","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","i